WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A twelve-minute audio sample sounds like a simple test.
But the first decision is what happens before you press play.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The seller's free-sample page also says you'll receive its newsletter.
That's separate from Final Vestige's Dispatch.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Trying a recording may tell you whether you enjoy the sound.
It cannot establish that twelve minutes equals an hour of meditation.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Premium has twelve levels and forty-eight MP3s.
Beginner and Advanced each contain six levels.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Compare with twelve quiet minutes and note what you actually finished.
Decide whether audio is worth paying for.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
The primary research and buyer checklist are here.
No checkout link is active pending commercial approval.
